        "description": "<p>One package of our Half-Shell Scallops is the only thing from the freezer, and the shells become the serving dish. Shell-off Scallops work too: serve them on a plate or over rice. The rest is cilantro, flat-leaf parsley, a jalape&ntilde;o and a serrano, a garlic clove, calamansi juice (or lime), olive oil, patis, avocado oil, kosher and flaky salt, and a red chili to finish.</p>",
